# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.
# .env.local is gitignored — never commit real credentials.
#
# Nothing here is required to run either front end today: both render against
# placeholder data. These are the values the backend will need once PRD §10
# (data model) and §11 (backend functions) are built.

# --- Application ---
# NODE_ENV=development
# PORT=3012

# --- Database (PRD §10) ---
# Postgres. The PRD's column types are written in Postgres terms.
# POSTGRES_URL=

# --- AI model (PRD §8, §11) ---
# NFR-01: model calls happen in backend functions only. Never expose a key to
# frontend code, and never prefix one of these with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
